<section data-name="Section - 40/60 text image" data-node-id="857:15228" data-role="split" data-layout="copy-first" data-variant="editorial"><div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="I857:15228;748:584;748:551" data-part="eyebrow">STAY WITH US</p>
<h2 data-node-id="I857:15228;748:584;748:552" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">Fourteen units, no two the same</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 173.965 46.4" style="width:4.349125em"><use href="{base}/typography/0d237297965a70bb3312.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 104.493 46.4" style="width:2.612325em"><use href="{base}/typography/0d237297965a70bb3312.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 49.161 46.4" style="width:1.229025em"><use href="{base}/typography/0d237297965a70bb3312.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 72.5 46.4" style="width:1.8125em"><use href="{base}/typography/0d237297965a70bb3312.svg#word-3" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 63.204 46.4" style="width:1.5801em"><use href="{base}/typography/0d237297965a70bb3312.svg#word-4" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 101.309 46.4" style="width:2.532725em"><use href="{base}/typography/0d237297965a70bb3312.svg#word-5" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">Six villas, one treehouse and seven glamping tents, placed so that each one faces something different. Choose by the view, by how much privacy you want, and by how far you feel like walking to dinner. The treehouse books out first, every season.</p>
<div data-part="actions"><a data-name="CTA" data-node-id="I857:15228;748:584;750:1289;750:1257" class="current-action" data-part="action" href="{base}/{edition}/where-you-sleep/">SEE WHERE YOU WILL SLEEP</a><button data-name="Link arrow button" data-node-id="750:1255" class="current-action" data-part="action" type="button" data-pending-link="" aria-label="Button — destination not supplied">Button</button></div></div>
<figure data-part="media" data-aspect="portrait"><img src="{base}/media/0ef67cbaf17027aee6cb.webp" alt="A villa guest room" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2400" height="1600"></figure></section>
<section data-name="Overlay panel rigth" data-node-id="857:15229" data-role="overlay"><figure data-part="media" data-aspect="landscape"><img src="{base}/media/81536a0be9ccf3efc5a4.webp" alt="The Frequency Dome surrounded by rainforest" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2400" height="1349"></figure><div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="I857:15229;750:1900;748:551" data-part="eyebrow">the frequency dome</p>
<h2 data-node-id="I857:15229;750:1900;748:552" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">The Dome is the reason this place exists</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 71.934 46.4" style="width:1.79835em"><use href="{base}/typography/ff0b575410123ac5b52e.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 116.954 46.4" style="width:2.92385em"><use href="{base}/typography/ff0b575410123ac5b52e.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 30.84 46.4" style="width:0.771em"><use href="{base}/typography/ff0b575410123ac5b52e.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 63.204 46.4" style="width:1.5801em"><use href="{base}/typography/ff0b575410123ac5b52e.svg#word-3" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 130.274 46.4" style="width:3.25685em"><use href="{base}/typography/ff0b575410123ac5b52e.svg#word-4" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 70.489 46.4" style="width:1.7622250000000002em"><use href="{base}/typography/ff0b575410123ac5b52e.svg#word-5" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 103.184 46.4" style="width:2.5796em"><use href="{base}/typography/ff0b575410123ac5b52e.svg#word-6" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 108.477 46.4" style="width:2.711925em"><use href="{base}/typography/ff0b575410123ac5b52e.svg#word-7" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">A dome of wood and glass at the high point of the property. Inside, sound arrives through the floor as much as through the air, so you feel the low end in your chest before you have decided what you think of it. At night it is lit, and you can see it from the far side of the valley. Sessions run most days, and you do not have to be staying here to sit in one.</p>
<div data-part="actions"><a data-name="CTA" data-node-id="I857:15229;750:1900;750:1289;750:1257" class="current-action" data-part="action" href="{base}/{edition}/frequency-experience/">Explore the Dome</a><a data-name="Link arrow button" data-node-id="I857:15229;750:1900;750:1289;750:1256" class="current-action" data-part="action" href="{base}/{edition}/frequency-experience/">What the Dome is</a></div></div></section>
