<p data-part="paragraph" data-node-id="I857:15232;857:14349;857:14223">Whoever is playing, in the Dome. [price], or free to guests.</p></div></article></div></section>
<section data-name="copy block" data-node-id="857:15233" data-role="copy" data-tone="white"><div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="I857:15233;857:15139" data-part="paragraph">Six things you can book online, with a date and a card, whether you are staying with us or at a hotel in town. A half day on the property. A sound session in the Dome. The volcano after dark. A ride along the river. An evening with whoever is playing.</p>
<div data-part="actions"><a data-name="CTA" data-node-id="I857:15233;857:15140" class="current-action" data-part="action" href="{base}/{edition}/experiences/">BOOK AN EXPERIENCE</a></div></div></section>
<section data-name="Section - 60/40 text image" data-node-id="857:15234" data-role="split" data-layout="image-first" data-variant="editorial"><figure data-part="media" data-aspect="portrait"><img src="{base}/media/d0b94379dbbf70b5d921.webp" alt="Dining at The Vessyl" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2400" height="2113"></figure>
<div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="I857:15234;750:1912;748:551" data-part="eyebrow">our culinary experience</p>
<h2 data-node-id="I857:15234;750:1912;748:552" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">You find out what is for dinner when you sit down</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 74.356 46.4" style="width:1.8588999999999998em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 74.825 46.4" style="width:1.870625em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 65.352 46.4" style="width:1.6338000000000001em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 91.875 46.4" style="width:2.296875em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-3" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 30.84 46.4" style="width:0.771em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-4" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 57.11 46.4" style="width:1.42775em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-5" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 124.59 46.4" style="width:3.11475em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-6" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 102.325 46.4" style="width:2.558125em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-7" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 70.801 46.4" style="width:1.770025em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-8" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 46.719 46.4" style="width:1.167975em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-9" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 105.04 46.4" style="width:2.6260000000000003em"><use href="{base}/typography/c815e43adce6125b0613.svg#word-10" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">The kitchen cooks what came out of the garden that morning and what arrived from the valley that afternoon, so the menu is written late and it changes every night. You eat at a long table with whoever else is here. If you would rather not, tell us and we will seat you on your own, and nobody will make it strange.</p>
<div data-part="actions"><button data-name="CTA" data-node-id="I857:15234;750:1912;750:1289;750:1257" class="current-action" data-part="action" type="button" data-pending-link="" aria-label="RESERVE A TABLE — destination not supplied">RESERVE A TABLE</button><button data-name="Link arrow button" data-node-id="750:1255" class="current-action" data-part="action" type="button" data-pending-link="" aria-label="Button — destination not supplied">Button</button></div></div></section>
<section data-name="Overlay panel" data-node-id="857:15235" data-role="overlay"><figure data-part="media" data-aspect="landscape"><img src="{base}/media/81536a0be9ccf3efc5a4.webp" alt="The Frequency Dome surrounded by rainforest" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2400" height="1349"></figure><div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="I857:15235;750:726;748:551" data-part="eyebrow">your own custom experience</p>
<h2 data-node-id="I857:15235;750:726;748:552" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">Take the whole property</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 90.489 46.4" style="width:2.262225em"><use href="{base}/typography/27189b119347cc3a1773.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 63.204 46.4" style="width:1.5801em"><use href="{base}/typography/27189b119347cc3a1773.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 114.942 46.4" style="width:2.87355em"><use href="{base}/typography/27189b119347cc3a1773.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 170.254 46.4" style="width:4.256349999999999em"><use href="{base}/typography/27189b119347cc3a1773.svg#word-3" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">Thirty-three guests, fourteen units, the Dome, the kitchen and 118 acres, with nobody else on the land. You run your programme. We run everything around it: rooms, food, sound, transport and staff. Most groups stay three to five days.</p>
<div data-part="actions"><button data-name="CTA" data-node-id="I857:15235;750:726;750:1289;750:1257" class="current-action" data-part="action" type="button" data-pending-link="" aria-label="PLAN A RETREAT — destination not supplied">PLAN A RETREAT</button><button data-name="Link arrow button" data-node-id="I857:15235;750:726;750:1289;750:1256" class="current-action" data-part="action" type="button" data-pending-link="" aria-label="INQUIRE ABOUT A GROUP — destination not supplied">INQUIRE ABOUT A GROUP</button></div></div></section>
<section data-name="Section - 50/50 text image" data-node-id="857:15236" data-role="split" data-layout="copy-first" data-variant="editorial"><div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="I857:15236;748:575;748:551" data-part="eyebrow">la fortuna, costa rica</p>
<h2 data-node-id="I857:15236;748:575;748:552" class="c-heading" data-part="heading"><span class="sr-only">Where you actually are</span><span class="type-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 123.809 46.4" style="width:3.095225em"><use href="{base}/typography/938358d1b2d8d12fd57c.svg#word-0" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 70.801 46.4" style="width:1.770025em"><use href="{base}/typography/938358d1b2d8d12fd57c.svg#word-1" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 148.145 46.4" style="width:3.703625em"><use href="{base}/typography/938358d1b2d8d12fd57c.svg#word-2" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg>{' '}<svg class="type-word" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 61.836 46.4" style="width:1.5459em"><use href="{base}/typography/938358d1b2d8d12fd57c.svg#word-3" width="100%" height="100%"></use></svg></span></h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">Arenal is a volcano, a lake, hot springs, waterfalls and a town called La Fortuna at the foot of all of it. Most people fly into San José and drive [hours]. We have written the practical version of the whole valley: how to get here, what is worth a day, and which months are worth paying more for.</p>
<div data-part="actions"><button data-name="CTA" data-node-id="I857:15236;748:575;750:1289;750:1257" class="current-action" data-part="action" type="button" data-pending-link="" aria-label="plan your visit — destination not supplied">plan your visit</button><button data-name="Link arrow button" data-node-id="750:1255" class="current-action" data-part="action" type="button" data-pending-link="" aria-label="Button — destination not supplied">Button</button></div></div>
